{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268qHNEcmwj21795139338.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>寒冷天氣警告生效，正午時分各區氣溫普遍跌至約12度。</p><p></p><p>在紅磡大環山海旁，天未光就有市民如常前來游早水，亦有市民跑步。天文台提醒進行戶外活動人士，要留意天氣變化，注意保暖。</p><p></p><p>天亮後維港兩岸天色昏暗，早上上班上學時間，不少市民穿了外套及頸巾。</p><p></p><p>天文台指，受強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，日間市區氣溫繼續下降，多處地區及高地寒冷。</p><p></p><p>隨後一兩日氣溫稍為回升。預料另一股東北季候風，會在下周二抵達華南沿岸，下周中期會再度轉涼。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.929260+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T04:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T05:57:11.774316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:17:17.521221+00:00","content_hash":"f01efa765b1920a0ed25cd4e379c99e5ec3024586c19c1c3b24cae446945a5e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.929260+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}